{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51812","headline":"题祝融峯（句） · 栖岩","name":"题祝融峯（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开云四边尽，浮世一齐低。\n（《五代诗话》七引《青琐集》）（〖1〗见《青琐高议前集》卷九。\n栖岩，疑爲栖蟾之误。\n《全唐诗》卷八四八收其南岳诗多首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}